    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18456" root="زوى" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُيَيَّةٌ</span></b>  dim. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَاىٌّ</span> [accord. to those who hold
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span> in the latter to be originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>, or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُوَيَّةٌ</span></b> 
accord. to those who hold that letter to be originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُيَيَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُوَيَّةٌ</span> as dims. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آءٌ</span> accord.
to different opinions: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span>, in the middle of
the first column]. (TA.)

